      "result": "## Test Completion Summary\n\nI have successfully validated all 16 test items for the Technical Specifications Knowledge Base application. **All tests PASSED** ✓\n\n### Test Results Overview:\n\n**Functionality Tests (FT):**\n- ✅ FT-1: Module filtering works - shows only selected module documents and restores full list with \"All\"\n- ✅ FT-2: Document view displays title, description, version, update date, sections, and related documents\n- ✅ FT-3: Related document links navigate to target documents successfully\n- ✅ FT-4: Collapsing sections hides content and disables links\n- ✅ FT-5: Expanding sections restores content and makes links accessible\n- ✅ FT-6: Knowledge graph nodes can be selected with visual feedback, zoom controls work with live feedback\n- ✅ FT-7: Graph contains all 20 documents with proper module associations and relationship connections\n- ✅ FT-8: Three views (Documents, Knowledge Graph, Favorites) are accessible and functional\n- ✅ FT-9: Tab switching preserves selected document, section states, and graph zoom level\n- ✅ FT-10: Favorites persist after page reload, update count immediately, survive filtering, and show all favorites regardless of module filters\n\n**Constraint Tests (CS):**\n- ✅ CS-12: No document lists itself as a related document or content-section reference\n- ✅ CS-13: Knowledge graph contains one node for each document with proper module associations and relationship edges\n\n**Interaction Tests (IX):**\n- ✅ IX-15: Section toggle indicators clearly show expanded/collapsed state matching visibility\n- ✅ IX-16: Clicking graph nodes opens documents in document view without requiring tab change; graph state preserved\n- ✅ IX-17: Clicking links in collapsed sections shows expand prompt; after expansion, links open target documents\n- ✅ IX-18: No-results message displays when search/filters match nothing; documents restore when criteria clear\n\nAll core functionality, state management, and user interactions are working as specified. The application successfully provides an organized technical documentation browser with advanced features like knowledge graphs, favorites persistence, and intelligent section management.",
